<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25062" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ismēnĭas</span></b> , ae,
			m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰσμηνίας.</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A celebrated Theban flute-player</i>,
					<i><span class="en">App. de Deo Socr. p. 53</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 37, 1,
				3, § 6</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A Theban general</i>, <i><span class="en">Nep.
				Pelop. 5, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Just. 5, 9, 6</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
